	<div class="row page-header-no-bg" data-alignment="left">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="col span_12 section-title">
				<h1>PyTorch Hub For Researchers</h1>

				
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>

<div class="container-wrap">
	<div class="container main-content" role="main">
		<div class="row">
			
<p class="has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Explore and extend models from the latest cutting edge research.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Discover and publish models to a pre-trained model repository designed for research exploration. Check out the models for&nbsp;<a href="https://pytorch.org/hub/#model-row">Researchers</a>, or learn&nbsp;<a href="https://pytorch.org/docs/stable/hub.html">How It Works</a>.&nbsp;<a href="https://github.com/pytorch/hub/blob/master/docs/template.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Contribute Models</a>.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">*This is a beta release &#8211; we will be collecting feedback and improving the PyTorch Hub over the coming months.</p>


